      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "……まぁ、はるか昔の城じゃからな。\r\nともあれ、ここは大人しく従うしかないの。",
        "official_en": "Yet in a castle as ancient as this... ’Twould not be outside the realm of reality. Regardless, we shall need to heed and obey their command.",
        "real_en": "Well, it is an ancient castle... Either way, I suppose we'll just have to do as the voice says."
      },
