      "text": {
        "jp": "いや、姿形を見たものはおらん。\r\nじゃが、こうして来訪者に\r\n語りかけてくるという噂じゃ……。",
        "official_en": "Nay, not one has seen so much as a shadow of them within the castle. Yet, ’tis rumored that they whisper into the ears of visitors.",
        "real_en": "No one has ever seen what they look like. But they say the voice speaks to visitors like this..."
      },
